  "body": "Some protocols _(like http with the keepalive time)_ and many other protocols require to send arbitrary ACK or TCP reset or set TCP flags.\nIt would be nice if this API can handle that in the same way of Wininet or the Unix socket API allow this...\n\nYou can alos look at the proposal I wrote on the raw socket API to get some ideas _(I know it is not stream compatible)_.\n",
